      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">16.018 Bishop</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Long, Robert H; Seattle F Design, Apr 93, p1</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Same outline as 16.016 The Grace Cut. Start pavilion </text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">preform by rolling a low cone at 30 degrees.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">39 facets + 5 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">1-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.137  T/W = 0.624  U/W = 0.609</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.502 C/W = 0.171</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.218</tspan>
